              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafarisayo ariphoona vira, amuuza Jesu, “Mbona anafundzio anahenda kazi Siku ya Kuoya? Lola! Anahenda dzambo ambaro si shariya kpwehu swiswi Ayahudi kuhendwa Siku ya Kuoya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
