              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.21.1+1SA.21.2+1SA.21.3+1SA.21.4+1SA.21.5+1SA.21.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Samueli 21:1–6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati Abiathari kala ndiye mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu, Daudi wamenya hema ra kumuabudu Mlungu, achirya mabofulo gotengbwa kpwa kazi ya Mlungu. Chishariya, alavyadzi-sadaka bahi ndiokala anaruhusiwa kugarya, ela Daudi warya, tsona achiapha ayae.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu Jesu achiaambira, “Siku ya Kuoya yaikirwa atu, wala siyo kukala atu aumbwa kpwa sababu ya Siku ya Kuoya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo, Mutu Yela Mlunguni, ndiye mwenye uwezo wa mambo gosi ga Siku ya Kuoya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
